### Login como Admin
POST https://localhost:7001/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login como User
POST https://localhost:7001/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "user",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Probar acceso admin
GET https://localhost:7001/api/v1/admin-check
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

### Probar acceso user
GET https://localhost:7001/api/v1/user-check
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user}}

### Verificar que User no puede acceder a la ruta de Admin (esperado: 403)
GET https://localhost:7001/api/v1/admin-check
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user}}
